diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 59dfaa7..4852111 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,15 @@
+sview (26.9+stereo3d6) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
+
+  * ORDER 579: a film with a picture and no audio track says so. The movie
+    player shows "This film has no sound." for six seconds when it has
+    loaded the film, and as a line under the cursor on the volume button
+    and bar (string 2115, in the ten languages of the edition and in Czech
+    and Russian). The volume control stays usable.
+  * This version carries ORDER 529's 26.9+stereo3d5 (the shared correction
+    codec) and so supersedes it.
+
+ -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
+
 sview (26.9+stereo3d5) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
 
   * Save JPEG/JPS corrections through libstereo-policy's Qt-free JPEG
